    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont really want to go to the doctor right now if i can help it, it's so expensive and i'm pretty busy. is there anything i can just do at home to make the floaters go away? like maybe some specific eye drops or a certain vitamin i should take? i just want to fix it quickly so i can get back to work.",
