      "content": "I can't recommend specific treatments or eye drops without a proper diagnosis. However, there are a few things you can try at home to potentially alleviate the discomfort. Warm compresses on the affected eye may help relax the muscles and reduce floaters, but be cautious not to overdo it. Reducing screen time and taking regular breaks to rest your eyes might also help alleviate eye strain, but it won't address the underlying issue.",
