      "content": "thanks, i'll try the warm compress thing. but like, i'm actually kinda worried it might be something serious like a stroke or my retina peeling off or something my friend mentioned? it just feels so sudden and weird. is there any way to tell if it's actually an emergency or if i can just wait a few days to see if it clears up on its own? i'm really trying to avoid the er if i can.",
